    {
      "id": "claim_fdacecc8b28d47d29e0dcf3ee4c7ff93",
      "statement": "The LOCAL cache backend requires no deployment: CACHE_HIERARCHY=LOCAL writes self-contained JSON files into the directory passed to CacheManager.setCacheDir(...), and that directory is the replication artifact — replicators can re-run offline with CACHE_HIERARCHY=LOCAL without API keys, Redis, or model access.",
