    {
      "id": "claim_be0c1b3db8194cd1b9ac4791a8dd1b83",
      "statement": "Deploying REST-Redis is Docker-based: write a server_config.json (redis_host, redis_port, http_port), run Redis and the REST-Redis server via Docker Compose (mounting the config read-only), and point clients at CACHE_HIERARCHY=REST_REDIS,LOCAL with REST_REDIS_URI — applications need no extra dependency because the matching REST-Redis client is bundled in this library.",
