      "id": "claim_25cb465c5f1d4b6abbe9c97136f7d66e",
      "statement": "RestRedisCache extends RedisCache and overrides only connection setup (wrapping the rest-redis Client in a RestRedisAdapter behind UnifiedRedisClient), so it inherits both the fail-fast PING contract (closes the client and throws IllegalStateException naming the URI on failed PING) and the storage model of Redis hashes keyed by the JSON cache key with data and timestamp fields.",
